license: "MIT"

abstract: >
  This repository contains the code for LMV-Net, a longitudinal
  multi-view deep learning model for breast cancer risk prediction.
  LMV-Net jointly models complementary CC and MLO mammographic views
  across multiple screening time points using explicit temporal
  alignment, dual-stream attention, and multi-view learning. The model
  is evaluated on the EMBED and CSAW-CC datasets and demonstrates
  improved breast cancer risk prediction across follow-up years,
  breast density categories, and cancer subgroups. The repository
  provides preprocessing, training, inference, and evaluation pipelines
  to facilitate reproducible research and comparison with existing
  breast cancer risk prediction methods.